  "description_text": "Located on the most sought-after block in Southport corridor and ideally situated on an extra-wide 37.5 foot lot, this architecturally significant, design inspired home has been thoroughly planned to provide a thoughtful layout and awe-inspiring features to enhance day-to-day life. With just over 7100 sqft of living space, the expansive floor plan provides 7 bedrooms, 7 full baths and 2 half baths. Throughout the home, you'll notice towering ceiling heights, oversized windows and rooms on a grand scale. The layout provides dedicated office space, a wellness center with a sauna and cold plunge, temperature controlled wine storage and an extra living room with a beautiful veranda that provides skyline views. multiple private outdoor areas, ideal for entertaining. Directly off the great room you'll find a professional grade outdoor kitchen and fireplace with direct access to the oversized porcelain paved garage roof deck. The three car attached garage leads to a radiant heated breezeway with a custom built mudroom to catch all of you miscellaneous items. The professionally designed kitchen is the centerpiece of the home and anchors the great room. The oversized island is enveloped in beautiful, soft close cabinetry, exceptional natural stone and oversized, professional grade, subzero, and Wolf appliances. Designer finishes include custom millwork, white oak cabinetry, organized closets, beautiful natural stone, custom tile work and hardwired infrastructure for an AV system. Centrally located you are just minutes from top ranked Hamilton Elementary and everything Southport Corridor has to offer. The area is home to award-winning restaurants, shopping and entertainment. You'll be close, but not too close to Wrigley Field, steps to public transportation, and just a short distance to Lake Michigan.Upgrade available for optional elevator service to all levels. * Renderings and plans are intended to convey design vision and are for marketing purposes only. Final layouts, materials, and finishes may vary at the Seller's discretion. Buyer(s) and their representation should confirm all specifications and selections prior to purchase. Developer is a licensed real estate agent in Illinois.",
